---
name: Return request received
section: Returns
subject: We've received your return request for order {{ order.name }}
---
{%- capture email_title -%}We've received your return request{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture email_preheader -%}We'll review it and email you as soon as it's done.{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mk_eyebrow = 'Order ' | append: order.name -%}
{%- assign mk_order_url = order.customer_order_url | default: order.order_status_url -%}
<!-- body -->
<p style="%%p%%">Thank you for letting us know. We'll review your request and email you as soon as it's done, with everything you need to send the bag back.</p>

{%- assign mk_button_url = mk_order_url | default: mk_site -%}
{%- assign mk_button_label = 'View your order' -%}
{% render 'button' %}

{%- assign mk_section = 'Return summary' -%}
{% render 'section-start' %}
{% render 'return-items' %}
{% render 'section-end' %}
